mission, caller-task `php/eval-run`, both eval expression paths, atomic redeclaration fatal behavior, and service-backed end-to-end fixtures remain outstanding. The named tick, include, generator, lower-portable, publication, and broader gates were not run; no cross-host verification was done. No commit or push was made because the requested green gate was not reached.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
